As a CODA (Child of Deaf Adults), Ruby is the only
hearing person in her deaf family.

4
00:16:35,555 --> 00:16:41,555
When the family's fishing business is threatened, Ruby finds herself torn between
pursuing her love of music and her fear of abandoning her parents.

5
